{"id":31,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"探究と体験で自ら考え行動する力を養う","feature_description":"中央大学附属中学校は「自主・自治・自律」を基礎に、自ら考え、判断し、行動する力を育てます。事前学習と現地での考察を組み合わせる体験型学習に加え、教育の柱「教養総合」では身近な課題や世界の問題を発見・観察します。分野横断型の理数教育や英語力を高める国際交流、読書にも取り組み、思考力と表現力を養います。中学生は3年間で約60冊の課題図書を読み、英検受検にも取り組みます。","clubs":[{"id":467,"name":"中学野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hs.chuo-u.ac.jp/school/sc-club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":468,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hs.chuo-u.ac.jp/school/sc-club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":469,"name":"水球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hs.chuo-u.ac.jp/school/sc-club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":470,"name":"ESS部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hs.chuo-u.ac.jp/school/sc-club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":471,"name":"合唱部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hs.chuo-u.ac.jp/school/sc-club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":472,"name":"コンピュータ部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hs.chuo-u.ac.jp/school/sc-club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":473,"name":"美術・書道・文藝部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hs.chuo-u.ac.jp/school/sc-club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":474,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hs.chuo-u.ac.jp/school/sc-club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":475,"name":"生物部（Wild Life）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hs.chuo-u.ac.jp/school/sc-club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":476,"name":"地学研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hs.chuo-u.ac.jp/school/sc-club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":477,"name":"物理部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hs.chuo-u.ac.jp/school/sc-club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13132,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hs.chuo-u.ac.jp/school/sc-club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13133,"name":"硬式テニス部（男子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hs.chuo-u.ac.jp/school/sc-club/","verified_